WEBVTT

1
00:00.400 --> 00:02.580
There is one big difference with C#.

2
00:02.580 --> 00:06.434
In JavaScript, a variable that holds text may hold a number afterwards.

3
00:06.434 --> 00:15.038
C# is strongly typed: there the type is fixed. In JavaScript the type belongs to the value, not to the variable.
